   "id": "note1",
   "text": "**Text to SQL, generate to chat**\n\nSamplers pick a domain, a topic that follows it and a query type; LLM Text writes the tables and a question, LLM Code writes the SQL and a SQL validator checks it (all on Qwen3-30B-A3B via the `sql-writer` preset). Fine-tune trains Qwen2.5-Coder-7B on question -> sql with 10% held out, Benchmark judges the checkpoint on exactly those rows, and Chat With Checkpoint answers a new question.",
